00:05:04.550 --> 00:05:06.870
So I'll enter a
semantically similar query.

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:16.270
In the basic search
results, we don't really

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:19.250
see who Doctor Who is.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:23.280
But in semantic match, we end
